      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Data & FE\n1. Source - collection, cleansing, labelling\n2. Storage - SQL/NoSQL/document/graph\n3. ETL\n4. Data types - numerical(discrete/continuous), \ncategorical(ordinal/norminal), media/text\n5. Feature engineering - na, scaling, \ndiscretization, cat encoding (int, onehot, emb)\n6. Feature engineering - date type compression\n7. Feature enrichment - ways to generate new\n8. Feature quality - feature importance\n9. Others - privacy, biases",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Data & FE\n1. Source - collection, cleansing, labelling\n2. Storage - SQL/NoSQL/document/graph\n3. ETL\n4. Data types - numerical(discrete/continuous), categorical(ordinal/norminal), media/text\n5. Feature engineering - na, scaling, discretization, cat encoding (int, onehot, emb)\n6. Feature engineering - date type compression\n7. Feature enrichment - ways to generate new\n8. Feature quality - feature importance\n9. Others - privacy, biases",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
