      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Production\n1. Cloud/device deployment\n2. Model compression\n    * knowledge destillation (?)\n    * pruning: small numbers change to 0 and make model sparse\n    * quantization: use 8bit to represent 32bit values\n3. Test in production: shadow deployment and A/B testing\n4. Prediction pipeline: batch, online",
