    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 296,
      "versionNonce": 392681323,
      "index": "b5P",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "nl4tcPMW0oTKseVo-RyrJ",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 910.0428579461059,
      "y": 2973.3824220306287,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 941.3192138671875,
      "height": 625,
      "seed": 519166229,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1727084901042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Visual Search\n\nClarifying requirements\n1. Only images\n2. Daily added images: 1 Trillion images (total #images?)\n3. Crop and retrieve images\n4. Personalization to users\n5. Use image metadata such as image tags (what metadata?)\n6. Label data with user interactions - likes/dislikes/clicks, set a time threshold to label negative\n7. How fast is the response\n8. What business objective\n\nFrame ML problem\n1. ML objective - accurately retrieve similar\n2. I/O: input image using crop + user -> top k similar\n3. ML category: ranking/binary classification \n3.1. Representation learning, models?\n3.2. How to rank, rank all or only rank vicinity?\n\nData preparation\n1. Data type - Users, Images, Interactions \n    - user, query image, returned image, returned rank\n    - interaction type: impression, click    \n2. FE - Resizing, Scaling(pixel values 0-1), Z-score norm, \n    - Consistent: ensure images have consistent colour mode",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Visual Search\n\nClarifying requirements\n1. Only images\n2. Daily added images: 1 Trillion images (total #images?)\n3. Crop and retrieve images\n4. Personalization to users\n5. Use image metadata such as image tags (what metadata?)\n6. Label data with user interactions - likes/dislikes/clicks, set a time threshold to label negative\n7. How fast is the response\n8. What business objective\n\nFrame ML problem\n1. ML objective - accurately retrieve similar\n2. I/O: input image using crop + user -> top k similar\n3. ML category: ranking/binary classification \n3.1. Representation learning, models?\n3.2. How to rank, rank all or only rank vicinity?\n\nData preparation\n1. Data type - Users, Images, Interactions \n    - user, query image, returned image, returned rank\n    - interaction type: impression, click    \n2. FE - Resizing, Scaling(pixel values 0-1), Z-score norm, \n    - Consistent: ensure images have consistent colour mode",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1008,
      "versionNonce": 1429465285,
      "index": "b5Q",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "0e1ilI5K7a8BY3WlU6Czm",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 910.3814895910391,
      "y": 4265.978214292169,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 1127.019287109375,
      "height": 500,
      "seed": 682033307,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "9FZUKn_UcQX133tRLG3gW",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1727084901042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Visual Search\n\nEvaluation\n1. MRR - Mean Reciprocal Rank: AVG(1/Ri), mean reciprocal of the rank of the first relevant in all\n    - only consider the first relevant, \n2. Recall@K - #Relevant in top K / #Relevant total\n    - The total number of relevant might be too big\n3. Precision@K - #Relevant in top K / K\n    - Can not evaluate the rank quality\n4. mAP - mean Average Precision: \n    - it considers the rank which is good\n    - predicting first 3 relevant out of 5, but have a score smaller than first 2, which is not right\n4. nDCG\n    - DCG: Discounted cumulative gain\n    - IDCG: Ideal Discounted cumulative gain\n    - nDCG: Normalized Discounted cumulative gain\n    - works well for ranking, considers rank quality and top k quality\n    - primary shortcoming is that the ground truth relevance is not always available and obtaining it is expensive \n\nOnline evaluation: CTR, AVG daily/weekly/monthly time spent on suggested items",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Visual Search\n\nEvaluation\n1. MRR - Mean Reciprocal Rank: AVG(1/Ri), mean reciprocal of the rank of the first relevant in all\n    - only consider the first relevant, \n2. Recall@K - #Relevant in top K / #Relevant total\n    - The total number of relevant might be too big\n3. Precision@K - #Relevant in top K / K\n    - Can not evaluate the rank quality\n4. mAP - mean Average Precision: \n    - it considers the rank which is good\n    - predicting first 3 relevant out of 5, but have a score smaller than first 2, which is not right\n4. nDCG\n    - DCG: Discounted cumulative gain\n    - IDCG: Ideal Discounted cumulative gain\n    - nDCG: Normalized Discounted cumulative gain\n    - works well for ranking, considers rank quality and top k quality\n    - primary shortcoming is that the ground truth relevance is not always available and obtaining it is expensive \n\nOnline evaluation: CTR, AVG daily/weekly/monthly time spent on suggested items",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 816,
      "versionNonce": 921678347,
      "index": "b5R",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "ZMwddopOfDt5NslQUyuvi",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 916.4804413521588,
      "y": 4852.320997884636,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 1110.558837890625,
      "height": 675,
      "seed": 759697941,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1727084901042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Visual Search\n\nServing\n1. Prediction\n    - embedding generator\n    - top k retrieval\n        * exact nearest neighbours\n        * tree based ann: kdtree, R-tree\n        * LSH, Cluster based ANN, etc.\n        * ANN libs: Faiss, ScaNN\n    - ranker\n2. Indexing\n\n3. ANN steps\n    - vector transformation applied before indexing, incl dimension reduction, vector rotation\n    - vector encoding, contruct actual index for search, Trees, LSH, Quantization\n        * Annoy\n    - none exhaustive search\n\n4. Production\n    - cloud/device deployment\n    - model compression\n    - test in production: a/b test, shadow deployment\n    - batch or online prediction\n    - \n\nhttps://towardsdatascience.com/comprehensive-guide-to-approximate-nearest-neighbors-algorithms-8b94f057d6b6",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Visual Search\n\nServing\n1. Prediction\n    - embedding generator\n    - top k retrieval\n        * exact nearest neighbours\n        * tree based ann: kdtree, R-tree\n        * LSH, Cluster based ANN, etc.\n        * ANN libs: Faiss, ScaNN\n    - ranker\n2. Indexing\n\n3. ANN steps\n    - vector transformation applied before indexing, incl dimension reduction, vector rotation\n    - vector encoding, contruct actual index for search, Trees, LSH, Quantization\n        * Annoy\n    - none exhaustive search\n\n4. Production\n    - cloud/device deployment\n    - model compression\n    - test in production: a/b test, shadow deployment\n    - batch or online prediction\n    - \n\nhttps://towardsdatascience.com/comprehensive-guide-to-approximate-nearest-neighbors-algorithms-8b94f057d6b6",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
