      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Monitoring\n1. feature drift\n2. Ops metrics: #uptime, #cpu/gpu/memory, throughput, queue, etc\n3. Business, CTR, avg time spent on predicted, etc.\n4. Logs and Logs aggregation\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
