    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1599,
      "versionNonce": 2053586629,
      "index": "b5w",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "m4IwW40WUsEYO1azqwRK5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3167.350904608627,
      "y": 2972.190646948851,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 1158.359375,
      "height": 825,
      "seed": 997596987,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1727084901042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "People you may know\n\nClarify requirements\n1. business objective: grow network\n2. features: education, social context, location, recent activities, etc.\n3. friendship is symmetrical\n4. average connections\n5. the social graph is relatively stable\n6. need to rank?\n\n7. Compare with visual search\n    - recommend a list of items, but may not need to rank\n    - \n\n\nFrame ML problem\n1. model objective: accurately recommend items\n2. I/O: query item -> topK relevant items\n3. model category\n    - point wise LTR: how to leverage user's social network?\n    - edge prediction \n        * graph level, node level, edge level prediction\n\nData preparation\n1. User, Connection, Interaction\n    - Interaction types: Request connection, Accept, Search, Profile view, Comment\n2. FE\n    - demographic: name, gender, age, location\n    - number of: collections, followers, following, etc.\n    - account age: new user is less likely to contribute import feature\n    - affinities: education, work, contemporaries, major, industry, etc\n        * each user has a list of properties, the more properties they share, the more likely they form connection\n    - social affinities: profile view, number of connections in common, time disconnected mutual connections",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "People you may know\n\nClarify requirements\n1. business objective: grow network\n2. features: education, social context, location, recent activities, etc.\n3. friendship is symmetrical\n4. average connections\n5. the social graph is relatively stable\n6. need to rank?\n\n7. Compare with visual search\n    - recommend a list of items, but may not need to rank\n    - \n\n\nFrame ML problem\n1. model objective: accurately recommend items\n2. I/O: query item -> topK relevant items\n3. model category\n    - point wise LTR: how to leverage user's social network?\n    - edge prediction \n        * graph level, node level, edge level prediction\n\nData preparation\n1. User, Connection, Interaction\n    - Interaction types: Request connection, Accept, Search, Profile view, Comment\n2. FE\n    - demographic: name, gender, age, location\n    - number of: collections, followers, following, etc.\n    - account age: new user is less likely to contribute import feature\n    - affinities: education, work, contemporaries, major, industry, etc\n        * each user has a list of properties, the more properties they share, the more likely they form connection\n    - social affinities: profile view, number of connections in common, time disconnected mutual connections",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 368,
      "versionNonce": 834976779,
      "index": "b5x",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "2Zz2_FnLkQJJ2ngQc_k1K",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3166.0703509811096,
      "y": 3844.895814736888,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 812.8595581054688,
      "height": 250,
      "seed": 230888341,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1727084901042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "PYMK - (change to ranking problem)\nModelling\n1. Model selection - GNN, random walk, \n    - Node: demographic info, Edge: eg number of common schools and workplaces\n    - GCN, GraphSAGE, GAT, GIT, etc\n2. Training\n    - graph snapshot at time t\n    - node and edge features\n    - Create labels that the model is expected to predict\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PYMK - (change to ranking problem)\nModelling\n1. Model selection - GNN, random walk, \n    - Node: demographic info, Edge: eg number of common schools and workplaces\n    - GCN, GraphSAGE, GAT, GIT, etc\n2. Training\n    - graph snapshot at time t\n    - node and edge features\n    - Create labels that the model is expected to predict\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 230,
      "versionNonce": 1190993445,
      "index": "b5y",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "5KD_QkKvmQGNMG-qe47eJ",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 4088.5383315768777,
      "y": 3865.3846790391403,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 448.4996643066406,
      "height": 125,
      "seed": 120861083,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1727084901042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "GNN\n- adjacent matrix, adjacent list\n- Challenges of GNN\ndata is sparse if encode with adjacent matrix\nnot permutation invariant",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GNN\n- adjacent matrix, adjacent list\n- Challenges of GNN\ndata is sparse if encode with adjacent matrix\nnot permutation invariant",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 154,
      "versionNonce": 159842987,
      "index": "b5z",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "lPD1dpH_F258HSDeA6Eba",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3167.350905,
      "y": 4125.337144873959,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 386.75970458984375,
      "height": 100,
      "seed": 760418997,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1727084901042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "PYMK\nEvaluation\n1. can do ranking, use nDCG\n2. can do binary classification: use mAP",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PYMK\nEvaluation\n1. can do ranking, use nDCG\n2. can do binary classification: use mAP",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1588,
      "versionNonce": 2006111749,
      "index": "b60",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "Twfqq5EgU3PtDmdi7Z3aG",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2568.346732410719,
      "y": -152.45364030482332,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 1105.83935546875,
      "height": 600,
      "seed": 69243883,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1727086966148,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Nearby friends\n\nStep 1 - Design Scope\n1. How far is considered close?\n2. Do we need to consider rivers between two points?\n3. How many friends per person on average?\n4. What's the DAU (or total)? How many of them use nearby friends?\n5. Do we store location history?\n6. Inactive for 10min and will disappear from nearby friend list? or keep the last seen location?\n7. Privacy and data laws such as GDPR or CCPA?\n\n* FR\n    - list nearby friends sorted by distance(or timestamp)\n    - nearby list should be updated every few seconds\n* NFR\n    - HA, CAP, low latency, high scalability\n    - Reliability: can accept occasional data point loss but needs to be reliable overall\n* EST\n    - Assumption: 1 billion users, 10% use nearby list, 100 million BAU\n    - Concurrent 10 million: at any point of time, there are 10 million users online reporting location\n    - Assumption: 400 friends per user, all use nearby; 20 nearby per page, can load more\n    - QPS: 10million/30s\n    - Storage: Support the app records history location on every 5 minutes, (24*60/5)*10m = 2.88 billion daily\n    - 2.88G * 20 bytes = 56G daily storage, five years data: 112T storage",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nearby friends\n\nStep 1 - Design Scope\n1. How far is considered close?\n2. Do we need to consider rivers between two points?\n3. How many friends per person on average?\n4. What's the DAU (or total)? How many of them use nearby friends?\n5. Do we store location history?\n6. Inactive for 10min and will disappear from nearby friend list? or keep the last seen location?\n7. Privacy and data laws such as GDPR or CCPA?\n\n* FR\n    - list nearby friends sorted by distance(or timestamp)\n    - nearby list should be updated every few seconds\n* NFR\n    - HA, CAP, low latency, high scalability\n    - Reliability: can accept occasional data point loss but needs to be reliable overall\n* EST\n    - Assumption: 1 billion users, 10% use nearby list, 100 million BAU\n    - Concurrent 10 million: at any point of time, there are 10 million users online reporting location\n    - Assumption: 400 friends per user, all use nearby; 20 nearby per page, can load more\n    - QPS: 10million/30s\n    - Storage: Support the app records history location on every 5 minutes, (24*60/5)*10m = 2.88 billion daily\n    - 2.88G * 20 bytes = 56G daily storage, five years data: 112T storage",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 720,
      "versionNonce": 681709931,
      "index": "b61",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "D40lzmzY-J9AGGSQoauq-",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2567.240558111677,
      "y": 493.558462335031,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 456.29974365234375,
      "height": 800,
      "seed": 1262811979,
      "groupIds": [],
