      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Nearby friends\n\nStep 2: HLD, API, Data model\nHLD\n1. WebSocket servers\n    - Report location\n    - Location feeds\n    - Push notification\n2. Web servers\n    - Add/remove friends\n    - Auth\n    - User Status\n3. Location cache, location history DB\n4, MSG queue to update location to friend list\n\nAPI\n1. WebSocket *\n    - Periodic location update\n    - Client receives location updates *\n    - WebSocket initialization\n    - Subscribe to a new friend *\n    - Unsubscribe a friend *\n2. Rest API\n    - Add/remove friend\n    - Login/logout\n    - Profile\n\nData model\n1. location cache\n2. history db\n    - shard by id or time?\n    - rdbms or nosql?",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nearby friends\n\nStep 2: HLD, API, Data model\nHLD\n1. WebSocket servers\n    - Report location\n    - Location feeds\n    - Push notification\n2. Web servers\n    - Add/remove friends\n    - Auth\n    - User Status\n3. Location cache, location history DB\n4, MSG queue to update location to friend list\n\nAPI\n1. WebSocket *\n    - Periodic location update\n    - Client receives location updates *\n    - WebSocket initialization\n    - Subscribe to a new friend *\n    - Unsubscribe a friend *\n2. Rest API\n    - Add/remove friend\n    - Login/logout\n    - Profile\n\nData model\n1. location cache\n2. history db\n    - shard by id or time?\n    - rdbms or nosql?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1135235243,
      "index": "b65",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "3pFekEEMGjI-itcU0Zg5k",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
