      "updated": 1727302634289,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 2 - HLD, Data model, API\n\nHLD (location DB with large volume of write. stream location to logs.)\n1. Need WebSocket server for smooth map rendering? Or just http server for periodic refresh?\n2. Other components: location update service, route plan service, ETA service, road DB, traffic DB\n3. LB, Cache\n\nAPI:\n- POST: /map/location, { id, latitude, longitude }\nx - GET: /map/plan%src=xxx,xxx&dest=xxx,xxx\nv - GET: /map/plan%src=1+horace+st+stives&dest=Disneyland\n\nData model:\nUser - id, longitude, latitude, timestamp\nRoad - id, longitude, latitude, distance, timestamp\n\n\nStep 3 - Deep Dive\n\n\nStep 4 - Wrap up",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 2 - HLD, Data model, API\n\nHLD (location DB with large volume of write. stream location to logs.)\n1. Need WebSocket server for smooth map rendering? Or just http server for periodic refresh?\n2. Other components: location update service, route plan service, ETA service, road DB, traffic DB\n3. LB, Cache\n\nAPI:\n- POST: /map/location, { id, latitude, longitude }\nx - GET: /map/plan%src=xxx,xxx&dest=xxx,xxx\nv - GET: /map/plan%src=1+horace+st+stives&dest=Disneyland\n\nData model:\nUser - id, longitude, latitude, timestamp\nRoad - id, longitude, latitude, distance, timestamp\n\n\nStep 3 - Deep Dive\n\n\nStep 4 - Wrap up",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
